msgid "Key Parameter Descriptions:"
msgstr "关键参数说明："

msgid ""
"Only the key parameters specific to this model/scenario are described below."
" `max-model-len` and `max-num-seqs` need to be set according to the actual "
"usage scenario."
msgstr "以下仅描述该模型/场景特有的关键参数。`max-model-len` 和 `max-num-seqs` 需要根据实际使用场景进行设置。"

msgid "**Model-specific parameters:**"
msgstr "**模型特有参数：**"

msgid ""
"- `--enable-expert-parallel`: Must be enabled for the MoE architecture of GLM-5.\n"
"- `--tensor-parallel-size 16` / `--tensor-parallel-size 8`: Tensor parallelism within each DP rank. For A3 (16 NPUs), use `tp16`; for A2 (8 NPUs), use `tp8`.\n"
"- `--quantization ascend`: Enables Ascend quantization for w4a8/w8a8 quantized weights.\n"
"- `--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 3, \"method\": \"deepseek_mtp\", \"enforce_eager\": true}'`: Enables Multi-Token Prediction (MTP) speculative decoding with GLM-5's DeepSeek-style MTP draft model. `num_speculative_tokens` (3-5) controls how many tokens are speculated per step; `enforce_eager: true` is required because GLM-5 does not support graph-mode speculative decoding.\n"
"- `--enable-chunked-prefill` / `--enable-prefix-caching`: Recommended for long-context and multi-user scenarios — chunked prefill splits long prompts to improve TTFT, prefix caching reuses KV cache for shared prefixes (e.g., system prompts).\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'`: Enables graph capture for the decode phase only, improving decode performance by reducing kernel launch overhead.\n"
"- `--additional-config '{\"multistream_overlap_shared_expert\": true}'`: Overlaps shared-expert computation on an additional stream. Note: automatically disabled when `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`, as the two optimizations conflict."
msgstr ""
"- `--enable-expert-parallel`：必须为 GLM-5 的 MoE 架构启用。\n"
"- `--tensor-parallel-size 16` / `--tensor-parallel-size 8`：每个 DP rank 内的张量并行度。对于 A3（16 个 NPU），使用 `tp16`；对于 A2（8 个 NPU），使用 `tp8`。\n"
"- `--quantization ascend`：为 w4a8/w8a8 量化权重启用 Ascend 量化。\n"
"- `--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 3, \"method\": \"deepseek_mtp\", \"enforce_eager\": true}'`：使用 GLM-5 的 DeepSeek 风格 MTP 草稿模型启用多 token 预测（MTP）投机解码。`num_speculative_tokens`（3-5）控制每步推测的 token 数量；`enforce_eager: true` 是必需的，因为 GLM-5 不支持图模式投机解码。\n"
"- `--enable-chunked-prefill` / `--enable-prefix-caching`：推荐用于长上下文和多用户场景——chunked prefill 拆分长提示以改善 TTFT，prefix caching 为共享前缀（如系统提示）复用 KV cache。\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'`：仅对解码阶段启用图捕获，通过减少内核启动开销来提升解码性能。\n"
"- `--additional-config '{\"multistream_overlap_shared_expert\": true}'`：在额外的流上重叠共享专家计算。注意：当 `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1` 时自动禁用，因为这两种优化存在冲突。"

msgid "**Key environment variables:**"
msgstr "**关键环境变量：**"

msgid "**Performance tuning notes for single-node:**"
msgstr "**单节点性能调优说明：**"

msgid ""
"- For low-latency scenarios, use `dp1tp16` (data-parallel-size 1, tensor-parallel-size 16) and consider reducing `--max-num-seqs` and `--max-num-batched-tokens`.\n"
"- For high-throughput scenarios, increase `--max-num-seqs` and enable `--enable-prefix-caching`.\n"
"- For long-context scenarios (e.g., 200K), use w8a8 weight (more memory for KV cache) and set `--max-model-len` to the desired context length. Consider enabling `--enable-chunked-prefill`.\n"
"- If you encounter OOM, reduce `--gpu-memory-utilization`, `--max-num-seqs`, or `--max-model-len`. Disabling `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO` can also reduce memory usage (at the cost of performance)."
msgstr ""
"- 对于低延迟场景，使用 `dp1tp16`（data-parallel-size 1，tensor-parallel-size 16），并考虑减小 `--max-num-seqs` 和 `--max-num-batched-tokens`。\n"
"- 对于高吞吐量场景，增大 `--max-num-seqs` 并启用 `--enable-prefix-caching`。\n"
"- 对于长上下文场景（如 200K），使用 w8a8 权重（为 KV cache 留出更多内存），并将 `--max-model-len` 设置为所需的上下文长度。考虑启用 `--enable-chunked-prefill`。\n"
"- 如果遇到 OOM，请减小 `--gpu-memory-utilization`、`--max-num-seqs` 或 `--max-model-len`。禁用 `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO` 也可以减少内存使用（以性能为代价）。"

msgid "Key Parameter Descriptions for multi-node deployment:"
msgstr "多节点部署的关键参数说明："

msgid ""
"In addition to all single-node parameters described in [Single-Node Online "
"Deployment](#51-single-node-online-deployment), the following parameters are"
" specific to multi-node deployment:"
msgstr ""
"除了[单节点在线部署](#51-single-node-online-deployment)中描述的所有单节点参数外，以下参数专门用于多节点部署："

msgid "**Network and data parallel configuration:**"
msgstr "**网络和数据并行配置：**"

msgid ""
"- `HCCL_IF_IP`, `GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`: Network interface configuration for multi-node communication. Set `nic_name` to the network interface name (obtained via `ifconfig`) and `local_ip` to the current node's IP address. These must be correctly configured on each node for successful multi-node communication.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size`: Total number of data parallel ranks across all nodes. For 2-node deployment, typically set to `2`.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size-local`: Number of data parallel ranks on the current node. Usually set to `1` (one DP rank per node).\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address`: IP address of the data parallel master node (node 0). Must match the `local_ip` of the master node.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port`: RPC port for data parallel master communication. Must be the same across all nodes.\n"
"- `--headless`: Indicates this is a non-master node. Do not use on node 0.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank`: Starting rank offset for data parallel ranks on this node. Node 0 uses `0`, node 1 uses `1`."
msgstr ""
"- `HCCL_IF_IP`、`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`：多节点通信的网络接口配置。将 `nic_name` 设置为网络接口名称（通过 `ifconfig` 获取），将 `local_ip` 设置为当前节点的 IP 地址。每个节点都必须正确配置这些参数，多节点通信才能成功。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size`：所有节点上的数据并行 rank 总数。对于 2 节点部署，通常设置为 `2`。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size-local`：当前节点上的数据并行 rank 数。通常设置为 `1`（每个节点一个 DP rank）。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address`：数据并行主节点（节点 0）的 IP 地址。必须与主节点的 `local_ip` 匹配。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port`：数据并行主节点通信的 RPC 端口。所有节点必须相同。\n"
"- `--headless`：表示这是非主节点。不要在节点 0 上使用。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank`：此节点上数据并行 rank 的起始 rank 偏移量。节点 0 使用 `0`，节点 1 使用 `1`。"

msgid "**Multi-node performance tuning:**"
msgstr "**多节点性能调优：**"

msgid ""
"- For low-latency multi-node scenarios, keep `--data-parallel-size-local 1` to minimize cross-node communication.\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs` should be tuned based on available KV cache memory after model loading. For w8a8 on A3 multi-node, `16` is recommended. For w4a8 on A2 multi-node with long context, start with `2` and increase if memory permits.\n"
"- All nodes in a multi-node deployment must use identical `--tensor-parallel-size`, `--enable-expert-parallel`, and model weight path configurations."
msgstr ""
"- 对于低延迟多节点场景，保持 `--data-parallel-size-local 1` 以最小化跨节点通信。\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs` 应根据模型加载后可用的 KV cache 内存进行调整。对于 A3 多节点上的 w8a8，推荐使用 `16`。对于 A2 多节点上长上下文的 w4a8，从 `2` 开始，如果内存允许则增大。\n"
"- 多节点部署中的所有节点必须使用相同的 `--tensor-parallel-size`、`--enable-expert-parallel` 和模型权重路径配置。"

msgid "Key Parameter Descriptions for PD separation deployment:"
msgstr "PD 分离部署的关键参数说明："

msgid ""
"In addition to the single-node and multi-node parameters described above, "
"the following parameters are specific to Prefill-Decode disaggregation:"
msgstr "除了上述单节点和多节点参数外，以下参数专门用于 Prefill-Decode 分离："

msgid "**Mooncake KV transfer configuration (`--kv-transfer-config`):**"
msgstr "**Mooncake KV 传输配置（`--kv-transfer-config`）：**"

msgid ""
"- `\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeConnectorV1\"`: Uses Mooncake as the KV cache transfer connector between prefill and decode nodes.\n"
"- `\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"`: Set on prefill nodes — produces KV cache and sends it to decode nodes. Use `\"kv_consumer\"` on decode nodes.\n"
"- `\"kv_port\"`: Port for Mooncake KV transfer communication. Each node group should use a distinct port range.\n"
"- `\"use_ascend_direct\": true`: Enables Ascend direct (RDMA-like) transfer for KV cache, reducing latency.\n"
"- `\"prefill\"` / `\"decode\"` sections: Specify the `dp_size` and `tp_size` of the prefill and decode node groups respectively. These must match the actual deployment topology."
msgstr ""
"- `\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeConnectorV1\"`：使用 Mooncake 作为 prefill 和 decode 节点之间的 KV 缓存传输连接器。\n"
"- `\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"`：在 prefill 节点上设置 — 生成 KV 缓存并将其发送到 decode 节点。在 decode 节点上使用 `\"kv_consumer\"`。\n"
"- `\"kv_port\"`：Mooncake KV 传输通信的端口。每个节点组应使用不同的端口范围。\n"
"- `\"use_ascend_direct\": true`：启用 Ascend 直接（类似 RDMA）传输 KV 缓存，降低延迟。\n"
"- `\"prefill\"` / `\"decode\"` 部分：分别指定 prefill 和 decode 节点组的 `dp_size` 和 `tp_size`。这些必须与实际部署拓扑匹配。"

msgid "**Prefill node-specific configurations:**"
msgstr "**Prefill 节点特定配置：**"

msgid ""
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`: Enables fused MC2 operators (`dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe`) to optimize MoE communication. Constraints: `dispatch_ffn_combine` only for w8a8 and EP≤32; `mega_moe` works for w8a8/w4a8/bf16 with EP≤64. Both are incompatible with MTP and dynamic EPLB.\n"
"- `--additional-config '{\"enable_dsa_cp\": true}'`: Enables DSA context parallelism on prefill nodes to accelerate long-context prefill. Required for handling prompts up to 128K tokens."
msgstr ""
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`：启用融合 MC2 算子（`dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe`）以优化 MoE 通信。约束：`dispatch_ffn_combine` 仅适用于 w8a8 且 EP≤32；`mega_moe` 适用于 w8a8/w4a8/bf16 且 EP≤64。两者均与 MTP 和动态 EPLB 不兼容。\n"
"- `--additional-config '{\"enable_dsa_cp\": true}'`：在 prefill 节点上启用 DSA 上下文并行，加速长上下文 prefill。处理高达 128K token 的提示词时需要此配置。"

msgid "**Decode node-specific configurations:**"
msgstr "**Decode 节点特定配置：**"

msgid ""
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`: Enables MLA preprocess operation fusion on decode nodes to significantly improve decode performance. Consumes more NPU memory. In PD scenarios, enable MLAPO only on decode nodes.\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens 32`: Small batch token limit on decode nodes — decode processes one token per sequence per step, so batch tokens should be close to `max-num-seqs`.\n"
"- `--additional-config '{\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": true}'`: Enables the recomputation scheduler. When decode node KV cache is insufficient, requests are sent back to prefill nodes for KV cache recomputation. Recommended on both prefill and decode nodes in PD scenarios."
msgstr ""
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`：在 decode 节点上启用 MLA 预处理操作融合，显著提升 decode 性能。消耗更多 NPU 内存。在 PD 场景中，仅在 decode 节点上启用 MLAPO。\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens 32`：decode 节点上的小批量 token 限制 — decode 每步每个序列处理一个 token，因此批量 token 应接近 `max-num-seqs`。\n"
"- `--additional-config '{\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": true}'`：启用重计算调度器。当 decode 节点 KV 缓存不足时，请求被发送回 prefill 节点进行 KV 缓存重计算。建议在 PD 场景中的 prefill 和 decode 节点上都启用。"

msgid "**Common PD environment variables:**"
msgstr "**常见 PD 环境变量：**"

msgid ""
"- `ASCEND_AGGREGATE_ENABLE=1`, `ASCEND_A3_ENABLE=1`: A3-specific optimizations for communication aggregation.\n"
"- `ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1`: ACL operator initialization mode.\n"
"- `VLLM_MOONCAKE_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT=480`: Timeout (in seconds) for automatically releasing the prefill node's KV cache when a request is aborted.\n"
"- `LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$LD_LIBRARY_PATH:/usr/local/lib`: Required for Mooncake library loading."
msgstr ""
"- `ASCEND_AGGREGATE_ENABLE=1`, `ASCEND_A3_ENABLE=1`：A3 特定的通信聚合优化。\n"
"- `ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1`：ACL 算子初始化模式。\n"
"- `VLLM_MOONCAKE_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT=480`：请求中止时自动释放 prefill 节点 KV 缓存的超时时间（秒）。\n"
"- `LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$LD_LIBRARY_PATH:/usr/local/lib`：Mooncake 库加载所需。"

msgid "**MTP in PD scenarios:**"
msgstr "**PD 场景中的 MTP：**"

msgid ""
"- Prefill nodes typically use `\"num_speculative_tokens\": 1` for MTP (minimal speculation during prefill).\n"
"- Decode nodes use `\"num_speculative_tokens\": 3` for MTP to maximize decode throughput.\n"
"- Both prefill and decode nodes must use the same `\"method\": \"deepseek_mtp\"` and `\"enforce_eager\": true`."
msgstr ""
"- Prefill 节点通常使用 `\"num_speculative_tokens\": 1` 进行 MTP（prefill 期间最小化推测）。\n"
"- Decode 节点使用 `\"num_speculative_tokens\": 3` 进行 MTP 以最大化 decode 吞吐量。\n"
"- Prefill 和 decode 节点必须使用相同的 `\"method\": \"deepseek_mtp\"` 和 `\"enforce_eager\": true`。"

msgid ""
"For further explanation and restrictions of the environment variables above,"
" refer to: [envs.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/envs.py)."
msgstr ""
"有关上述环境变量的进一步说明和限制，请参阅：[envs.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/envs.py)。"

